The  driver provides support for the Intel chipset internal SMBus
host  interface  to  be  used  with  the  framework.    Supported
chipsets: ICH series.  PCH series.  63xxESB series.  C6xx series.
The  driver first appeared in It is based off of the driver.  The
driver was written by The driver  doesn’t  support  I2C  commands
with a data buffer size of more than 2 bytes.
